{"id":"5445","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5445_main_altostratus-opacus-mamma-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这种悬球状蔽光高层云是在一行积雨云单体的前缘上不断扩散的砧状云底面形成。这行单体在向东东北移动。悬球在靠近地平线右侧<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">极低</span>的位置。在左侧下方可看到一些层积云<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云块</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Mateusz Wojtala","location":"波兰，希隆斯克地区勒武韦克","latitude":"纬度: 51° 8' 39'' N","longitude":"经度: 15° 41' 57'' E","date":"16 June 2012 1747 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 2, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.5.13","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.5.13"},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5445_upper_altostratus-opacus-mamma-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>从东面100公里进行的探测 – 根据波兰Legnica Bartoszow当地时间16点的地面条件修改的抬升凝结高度。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5445_sat_altostratus-opacus-mamma-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>一行积雨云单体在西边发展，并在随后3小时向东东北飘过该地点。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2012","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}